<item><title>North Drain Piping - Ashley to Edward Street</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> This Contract is for the installation of a stormwater drain in the township of Rangiora.<br /><br />The main tasks involved in this Contract are:<br /><br />•	Supply and installation of the following stormwater infrastructure:<br /><br /> -	80m of concrete ducting 1250 series (1055 depth) with HN-HO-72 lids<br /><br /> -	450 sump as per Detail A, including coring into concrete ducting, cast in situ concrete infill, making good around penetrations and forming a neat finished connection.<br /><br /> -	3x manhole access frame and grate cast into concrete duct lid<br /><br /> -	Design and Build of Detail B cover for footpath use<br /><br />•	New footpath construction<br /><br />•	Trees cut down and ground to ground level<br /><br />•	Traffic Management<br /><br />•	Cutdown and reshape kerbs<br /><br />•	CCTV inspection<br /><br />•	Public notification and liaising with key stakeholders<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Waimakariri District Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 28/Oct/2026 04:00 pm (UTC+12:00) Auckland, Wellington time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP2687<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation, Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 5]]></description>
<link>https://www.vendorpanel.nz/PublicTenderAccess.aspx?id=8182642d558e4cfbbf993dad19c89d7fs2687</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">8182642d558e4cfbbf993dad19c89d7f</guid>
