<item><title>AgHort A Research Lab Refurbishment</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Mechanical and Architectural Design Consultants procured under Stage 1 of the Refurbishment Project are reaching the final stage of issuing designs for Construction, and Massey University now requires a head contractor for the end-to-end delivery of the AgHort A PC2 Laboratory Refurbishment commencing in 2026. <br /><br />The works involve the refurbishment, reconfiguration, and compliance upgrade of existing spaces to meet MPI PC2 containment standards, contemporary research and teaching requirements, and Massey University’s operational, safety, and quality expectations.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Massey University<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 20/Oct/2026 12:00 pm (UTC+12:00) Auckland, Wellington time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP2685<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Sophie Pita Email: s.pita@massey.ac.nz Tel: 0277236136<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 7]]></description>
<link>https://www.vendorpanel.nz/PublicTenderAccess.aspx?id=d4a7dde708074fad88b49577a1195394s2685</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">d4a7dde708074fad88b49577a1195394</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 03:41:00 GMT</pubDate>
<category>Building Trade, Repairs, Maint.</category>
<category>Construction &amp; Operation</category>
</item>
<item><title>Stormwater Treatment Devices Servicing</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> This Contract is for inspections and servicing of proprietary stormwater treatment devices (filters) at scheduled intervals throughout the Waimakariri District.<br /><br />The main tasks involved in this Contract are:<br /><br />• Programming of device inspections and servicing<br /><br />• Installing traffic management<br /><br />• Confined space entry<br /><br />• Inspecting devices to evaluate treatment performance<br /><br />• Servicing devices to return them to optimum operation including:<br /><br />o installation of pipeline bungs/bags<br /><br />o pipeline de-watering<br /><br />o wet-well cleaning (water-blasting inside of chambers)<br /><br />o flushing inlets and outlets<br /><br />o removal & installation of cartridges for cleaning and/or replacing<br /><br />• Disposal of waste to consented disposal facility<br /><br />• Monthly reporting to the Engineer/Project Manager<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Waimakariri District Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 21/Oct/2026 04:00 pm (UTC+12:00) Auckland, Wellington time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP2686<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Cleaning Services, Equip, Supplies, Construction & Operation, Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 6]]></description>
<link>https://www.vendorpanel.nz/PublicTenderAccess.aspx?id=bbf27283fd1441e59b9907db2d30497ds2686</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">bbf27283fd1441e59b9907db2d30497d</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 21:19:00 GMT</pubDate>
<category>Cleaning Services, Equip, Supplies</category>
<category>Construction &amp; Operation</category>
